            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Angefog"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Overall, this is a clever and tasty recipe. There are so many ways to customize it. I used sweet onion, herb chicken sausage and added some navy beans. The beans took it into a more Italian style direction and toned down the sweetness of the soup (because typically I don't like the flavor of canned tomato soup). However next time I will try it without the beans because the sauce did taste great even before I put the beans in.",
